  "id": "ft",
  "term": "FT",
  "definition": "FT refers to fraction of time in dynamic functional network connectivity analysis: the proportion of sliding time windows that are assigned to a particular brain connectivity state. It is used to describe how much time the brain spends in that recurring state over the course of measurement.",
